=== 4. Sentence-2 producer: one rounded source, no re-subtraction ===
grep over web/templates + web/static/js for any cash-flow classification shows
exactly two sites, both in kpis.html and both keyed on the SAME `$flow.Balance`:
  L6  lead:  {{if lt $flow.Balance 0.0}}...did not cover...{{else if gt $flow.Balance 0.0}}...exceeded...{{else}}...matched spending.{{end}}
  L25 tile:  <p class="num text-4xl ... {{if lt $flow.Balance 0.0}}text-negative{{else}}...}}">{{formatMoney $flow.Balance}}</p>
The Explanation string comes from the same struct
(internal/services/metrics/reporting.go ReportingCashFlow: Income/Spending
rounded by ReportingMoney first, Balance = ReportingMoney(Income-Spending),
switch on Balance <0 / >0 / else). No raw float and no re-subtraction anywhere
in the template.
Probe render (rf2_probe/internal/templates/zz_probe_checker_test.go, scratch only):
  FIXTURE inc=10.001 exp=9.999
    producer Balance=0 Explanation="Recorded income matches spending"
    LEAD  = "No budget is set for this period. Recorded income matched spending."
