    LEAD  = "No budget is set for this period. Recorded income exceeded spending by <span class=\"num\">$0.01</span>."
    TILE figure = "$0.01"  tile explanation = "Recorded income above spending"
Both fixtures: lead and tile agree, exactly as ruling RF-2026-09-07b(3) requires.

