computed styles on the rendered dashboard are root 17px, #dashboard-lead 21.25px,
tile figure 38.25px (text-4xl), tile <h2> 17px (text-base).
Overflow (Playwright, chromium-1243, --no-sandbox, http://localhost:8147/dashboard):
  1280: every #dashboard-overview .num scrollWidth == clientWidth (263/263 x3);
        each tile 297/297; documentElement 1280/1280 -> no overflow.
  390 : .num 320/320 x3; tiles 354/354; documentElement 390/390 -> no overflow.
  Widest available data (2020-01-01..2026-12-31, figures $128,916.64 /
  -$41,721.76 / $746,342.97) at 390: .num 320/320, tiles 354/354, doc 390/390.
